<% content_for :meta_description, "Fleet GPS tracking, immutable chain-of-custody logging, and FDA-ready compliance PDFs for pharmaceutical transport." %>

<div class="space-y-16">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="text-center space-y-6 py-8">
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight">
      Chain-of-custody documentation<br class="hidden sm:block"> pharmaceutical transport can't fake.
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Track your fleet, log every custody handoff, and generate FDA-ready compliance
      documentation automatically — instead of reconstructing a shipment's history from memory
      when someone asks for it.
    </p>
    <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap pt-2">
      <%= link_to "Sign up", new_user_registration_path,
            class: "bg-accent-600 hover:bg-accent-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg transition" %>
      <%= link_to "See pricing", pricing_path,
            class: "bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 text-brand-700 font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg text-lg border-2 border-brand-200 transition" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Features -->
  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    <div class="border rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="text-2xl">📍</div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Live fleet GPS tracking</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Real-time vehicle positions, scoped to your organization — not a demo map with fake trucks on it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="text-2xl">🔗</div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Immutable custody log</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Every handoff — pickup, transfer, delivery — logged as a hash-chained record that can't be quietly edited after the fact.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="text-2xl">📄</div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">FDA-ready Compliance Packets</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Generated PDFs covering chain-of-custody and temperature monitoring — built for 21 CFR Part 11 documentation needs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="border rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
      <div class="text-2xl">✍️</div>
      <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Proof-of-delivery signatures</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">Captured at the point of delivery and attached directly to the custody record it belongs to.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Why trust this -->
  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-8 space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Built to hold up, not just demo well</h2>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm text-gray-700">
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Live in production</div>
        Real signup, real email confirmation, real Stripe billing — this is the actual product, not a mockup.
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Security posture</div>
        Static analysis (Brakeman) and dependency auditing run clean on every change; rate limiting on auth endpoints.
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Compliance-first design</div>
        Custody records are hash-chained rather than freely editable — built around what an audit trail actually needs to prove.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content / DSCSA hook -->
  <div class="border-t pt-8 text-center space-y-3">
    <p class="text-gray-600">
      Running a small pharmacy? The FDA's small-dispenser DSCSA exemption ends
      <strong>November 27, 2026</strong>.
    </p>
    <%= link_to "Read what changes →", blog_dscsa_exemption_2026_path, class: "text-brand-700 font-semibold hover:underline" %>
  </div>
</div>
